sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as 前端 Web UI
    participant WS as FastAPI WebSocket
    participant ROUTE as route.py
    participant SVC as service.py
    participant SM as session_manager.py
    participant NORM as normalizer.py
    participant SDK as claude_agent_sdk

    Note over UI,SDK: 主链路：发送消息 → 流式回复（v0.1.6 thread-bound 路径）
    UI->>WS: 连接 /ws/claude-code?thread_id=thread-xyz
    Note over WS,ROUTE: ROUTE 校验 thread_id：格式 + 存在 + backend_kind=claude_code（v0.1.6）
    UI->>WS: { type: "claude-command", command: "帮我写函数", options: { cwd: "/path" } }
    WS->>ROUTE: 路由
    ROUTE->>SVC: query(command, options, ws, register_id_override=thread-xyz)
    SVC->>SM: register("thread-xyz", ws)
    Note over SVC,SM: v0.1.6：直接用 thread_id 注册，<br/>替代 v0.1 的 placeholder pending-XXX
    SVC->>SDK: query(prompt, options=ClaudeAgentOptions(<br/>include_partial_messages=True,<br/>cwd, model, ...))

    loop async for msg in queryInstance
        SDK-->>SVC: SystemMessage(subtype="init", session_id="abc")
        SVC->>SM: rename("thread-xyz" → "abc") if 不一致<br/>v0.1 placeholder→rename 也走此路径
        SVC->>NORM: handle(msg)
        NORM-->>UI: { kind: "session_created", sessionId: "abc" }

        SDK-->>SVC: StreamEvent(content_block_delta, delta="我")
        SVC->>NORM: handle(msg)
        NORM-->>UI: { kind: "stream_delta", content: "我", sessionId: "abc" }

        SDK-->>SVC: AssistantMessage(TextBlock("我帮你..."))
        SVC->>NORM: handle(msg)
        NORM-->>UI: { kind: "text", role: "assistant", content: "我帮你...", sessionId: "abc" }

        SDK-->>SVC: ResultMessage(stop_reason="end_turn", usage={...})
        SVC->>NORM: handle(msg)
        NORM-->>UI: { kind: "complete", exitCode: 0, sessionId: "abc", tokenBudget: {...} }
    end

    SVC->>SM: unregister_active(sessionId)

    Note over UI: 用户刷新页面 / 重连
    UI->>WS: 新 WS 连接
    UI->>WS: { type: "check-session-status", sessionId: "abc" }
    WS->>ROUTE: 路由
    ROUTE->>SM: is_active("abc") + replace_writer("abc", new_ws)
    SM-->>UI: { type: "session-status", isProcessing: true }
    Note over SVC,UI: SDK message 流自然推到新 ws<br/>不需要 SDK resume / 不需要补发任何事件
